{
  "name": "Autonomous Task Executor",
  "version": "3.0.0",
  "description": "Enables autonomous overnight development - references steering files for detailed rules",
  "when": {
    "type": "agentStop"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🌙 AUTONOMOUS MODE\n\nSESSION START:\n1. Check context transfer summary (if present)\n2. Read steering files (00-global.md has full workflow)\n3. Identify next task\n\nWORKFLOW (per task):\n1. Check CI/CD: node scripts/check-cicd-status.js\n2. Implement (code + tests + docs)\n3. Commit: node scripts/safe-commit-push.js \"feat: [description]\"\n4. Monitor CI/CD, continue to next\n\nFAILURE HANDLING:\n- Validation: Fix, retry (max 3)\n- CI/CD: Analyze, fix, retry (max 2)\n- Still failing: Document, continue\n\nREFERENCE: All detailed rules in .kiro/steering/00-global.md"
  },
  "enabled": true,
  "workspaceFolderName": "budgetbuddy",
  "shortName": "autonomous-task-executor"
}
